      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           BEECHTREE LANE                                                  (west side) 9/252                                            Nos 1 and 2(Hill End                                                  Farm Cottages) GV                                               II Pair of cottages on a T plan with lobby-entrance range at front. Mid-late C17.  Exposed timber frame.  Plain tile roof.  Large central red brick chimney stack with 4 joined shafts on a cross plan.  Front range is two and a half bays.  3 sash windows;  3 lights on outside, 2 lights in middle.  Pair of C20 doors.  Rear projection with C19/20 similar stack. Listing NGR: TL1087406514"
    }
